XJ380 includes the following components derived from MikanOS:

- font/hankaku.bin
  Derived from kernel/hankaku.txt (8x16 bitmap font), converted with the
  upstream makefont.py layout rules. Verified byte-identical to the upstream
  conversion.

- include/efi/fbc.h and boot/include/fbc.h
  Derived from kernel/frame_buffer_config.hpp. The FrameBufferConfig struct
  retains the upstream field names and order; enum PixelFormat values were
  renamed locally (kRGBR/kBGRR).

- include/graphics/GOP.hpp
  Derived from kernel/graphics.hpp (PixelColor and the FrameBufferWriter
  PixelAt/Write helpers).

These files were modified by XINGJI Studios for use in XJ380. The upstream
copyright and attribution notices are retained in the file headers and in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
